<title>USA: Watertown, Mass, won by BayBank.</title>
<headline>Watertown, Mass, won by BayBank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank Boston said it won $4.768 million of Watertown, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.59 percent.</p>
</text>
